[
  {"type": "math_show", "q": "Find the equation in standard form of the circle with center at $(1,4)$ and tangent to the line $y = -3$.", "c": "<strong>အဖြေရှင်းလင်းချက်:</strong><br><br>Given: Center $(h,k) = (1,4)$<br><br>The circle is tangent to the line $y = -3$.<br><br>Step 1: The radius is the perpendicular distance from the center to the tangent line.<br><br>Distance from $(1,4)$ to $y = -3$:<br><br>$r = |4 - (-3)| = |4 + 3| = 7$<br><br>Step 2: Using the standard form of a circle:<br><br>$(x-h)^2 + (y-k)^2 = r^2$<br><br>$(x-1)^2 + (y-4)^2 = 7^2$<br><br><strong>$(x-1)^2 + (y-4)^2 = 49$</strong><br><svg viewBox=\"0 0 460 330\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Circle center (1, 4) radius 7\" data-chapter-graph=\"1\"><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#1e1e1e\"/><defs><clipPath id=\"cg349\"><rect x=\"50\" y=\"30\" width=\"386\" height=\"258\"/></clipPath></defs><line x1=\"140.1\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"140.1\" y2=\"288\" stroke=\"#2A3548\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"327.2\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"327.2\" y2=\"288\" stroke=\"#2A3548\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"420.7\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"420.7\" y2=\"288\" stroke=\"#2A3548\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"243.2\" x2=\"436\" y2=\"243.2\" stroke=\"#2A3548\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"149.6\" x2=\"436\" y2=\"149.6\" stroke=\"#2A3548\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"102.9\" x2=\"436\" y2=\"102.9\" stroke=\"#2A3548\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"56.1\" x2=\"436\" y2=\"56.1\" stroke=\"#2A3548\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"196.4\" x2=\"436\" y2=\"196.4\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><polygon points=\"436,196.4 428,192.4 428,200.4\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"434\" y=\"188.4\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"end\">x</text><line x1=\"233.6\" y1=\"288\" x2=\"233.6\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><polygon points=\"233.6,30 229.6,38 237.6,38\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"241.6\" y=\"34\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"13\">y</text><text x=\"239.6\" y=\"210.4\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\">O</text><text x=\"140.1\" y=\"212.4\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">-10</text><text x=\"327.2\" y=\"212.4\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">10</text><text x=\"420.7\" y=\"212.4\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">20</text><text x=\"227.6\" y=\"247.2\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\">-5</text><text x=\"227.6\" y=\"153.6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\">5</text><text x=\"227.6\" y=\"106.9\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\">10</text><text x=\"227.6\" y=\"60.1\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\">15</text><g clip-path=\"url(#cg349)\"><ellipse cx=\"243.0\" cy=\"159.0\" rx=\"65.5\" ry=\"65.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#00EDFF\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><line x1=\"243.0\" y1=\"159.0\" x2=\"308.5\" y2=\"159.0\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/></g><text x=\"272.5\" y=\"159.0\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"start\">r = 7</text><circle cx=\"243.0\" cy=\"159.0\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#F0B90B\" stroke=\"#1e1e1e\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"251.0\" y=\"153.0\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"start\">center (1, 4)</text></svg>"},
  {"type": "math_show", "q": "Find the center and radius of the equation $x^2 + y^2 + 2gx + 2fy + c = 0$.", "c": "<strong>အဖြေရှင်းလင်းချက်:</strong><br><br>Given: $x^2 + y^2 + 2gx + 2fy + c = 0$<br><br>Step 1: Rearrange the equation by completing the square.<br><br>$x^2 + 2gx + y^2 + 2fy = -c$<br><br>Step 2: Complete the square for $x$ and $y$ terms.<br><br>$(x^2 + 2gx + g^2) + (y^2 + 2fy + f^2) = g^2 + f^2 - c$<br><br>$(x + g)^2 + (y + f)^2 = g^2 + f^2 - c$<br><br>Step 3: Compare with standard form $(x-h)^2 + (y-k)^2 = r^2$.<br><br>Center: $(h,k) = (-g, -f)$<br><br>Radius: $r = \\sqrt{g^2 + f^2 - c}$<br><br><strong>center $= (-g, -f)$, radius $= \\sqrt{g^2 + f^2 - c}$</strong>"},
  {"type": "math_show", "q": "The line $x - 1 = 0$ is the directrix of a parabola $(y-1)^2 = k(x+2)$. Find the value of $k$.", "c": "<strong>အဖြေရှင်းလင်းချက်:</strong><br><br>Given: Parabola $(y-1)^2 = k(x+2)$<br><br>Directrix: $x - 1 = 0$, i.e., $x = 1$<br><br>Step 1: Rewrite the parabola in standard form.<br><br>$(y-1)^2 = k(x+2) = k(x-(-2))$<br><br>Comparing with $(y-k)^2 = 4p(x-h)$:<br><br>Vertex: $(h,k) = (-2, 1)$<br><br>$4p = k$, so $p = \\frac{k}{4}$<br><br>Step 2: For a parabola opening left (since directrix is to the right of vertex):<br><br>$(y-k)^2 = -4p(x-h)$ where $p > 0$<br><br>Directrix: $x = h + p = -2 + p = 1$<br><br>So $p = 3$<br><br>Step 3: Since $k = -4p$ (opens left):<br><br>$k = -4(3) = -12$<br><br><strong>$k = -12$</strong>"},
  {"type": "math_show", "q": "Find the center and radius of the circle $x^2 + 2x + y^2 + 4y + 4 = 0$.", "c": "<strong>အဖြေရှင်းလင်းချက်:</strong><br><br>Given: $x^2 + 2x + y^2 + 4y + 4 = 0$<br><br>Step 1: Group $x$ and $y$ terms.<br><br>$(x^2 + 2x) + (y^2 + 4y) = -4$<br><br>Step 2: Complete the square.<br><br>$(x^2 + 2x + 1) + (y^2 + 4y + 4) = -4 + 1 + 4$<br><br>$(x + 1)^2 + (y + 2)^2 = 1$<br><br>Step 3: Compare with $(x-h)^2 + (y-k)^2 = r^2$.<br><br>Center: $(h,k) = (-1, -2)$<br><br>Radius: $r = \\sqrt{1} = 1$<br><br><strong>center $= (-1, -2)$, radius $= 1$</strong><br><svg viewBox=\"0 0 460 330\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Circle center (-1, -2) radius 1\" data-chapter-graph=\"1\"><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#1e1e1e\"/><defs><clipPath id=\"cg350\"><rect x=\"50\" y=\"30\" width=\"386\" height=\"258\"/></clipPath></defs><line x1=\"118.2\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"118.2\" y2=\"288\" stroke=\"#2A3548\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"201.4\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"201.4\" y2=\"288\" stroke=\"#2A3548\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"367.8\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"367.8\" y2=\"288\" stroke=\"#2A3548\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"242.2\" x2=\"436\" y2=\"242.2\" stroke=\"#2A3548\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"159.0\" x2=\"436\" y2=\"159.0\" stroke=\"#2A3548\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"75.8\" x2=\"436\" y2=\"75.8\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><polygon points=\"436,75.8 428,71.8 428,79.8\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"434\" y=\"67.8\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"end\">x</text><line x1=\"284.6\" y1=\"288\" x2=\"284.6\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><polygon points=\"284.6,30 280.6,38 288.6,38\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"292.6\" y=\"34\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"13\">y</text><text x=\"290.6\" y=\"89.8\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\">O</text><text x=\"118.2\" y=\"91.8\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">-4</text><text x=\"201.4\" y=\"91.8\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">-2</text><text x=\"367.8\" y=\"91.8\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><text x=\"278.6\" y=\"246.2\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\">-4</text><text x=\"278.6\" y=\"163.0\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\">-2</text><g clip-path=\"url(#cg350)\"><ellipse cx=\"243.0\" cy=\"159.0\" rx=\"41.6\" ry=\"41.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#00EDFF\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><line x1=\"243.0\" y1=\"159.0\" x2=\"284.6\" y2=\"159.0\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/></g><text x=\"261.7\" y=\"159.0\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"start\">r = 1</text><circle cx=\"243.0\" cy=\"159.0\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#F0B90B\" stroke=\"#1e1e1e\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"251.0\" y=\"153.0\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"start\">center (-1, -2)</text></svg>"},
  {"type": "math_show", "q": "Write down the focus and directrix of $x^2 + 8y = 0$.", "c": "<strong>အဖြေရှင်းလင်းချက်:</strong><br><br>Given: $x^2 + 8y = 0$<br><br>Step 1: Rewrite in standard form.<br><br>$x^2 = -8y$<br><br>Step 2: Compare with $x^2 = -4py$.<br><br>$-4p = -8$<br><br>$p = 2$<br><br>Step 3: For $x^2 = -4py$ (opens downward):<br><br>Focus: $(0, -p) = (0, -2)$<br><br>Directrix: $y = p = 2$<br><br><strong>focus $F(0, -2)$, directrix is $y = 2$</strong>"},
  {"type": "math_show", "q": "Write down the equation of unit circle.", "c": "<strong>အဖြေရှင်းလင်းချက်:</strong><br><br>A unit circle is a circle with center at the origin $(0,0)$ and radius $r = 1$.<br><br>Step 1: Using the standard form $(x-h)^2 + (y-k)^2 = r^2$.<br><br>With $(h,k) = (0,0)$ and $r = 1$:<br><br>$(x-0)^2 + (y-0)^2 = 1^2$<br><br>$x^2 + y^2 = 1$<br><br><strong>$x^2 + y^2 = 1$</strong><br><svg viewBox=\"0 0 460 330\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Circle center (0, 0) radius 1\" data-chapter-graph=\"1\"><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#1e1e1e\"/><defs><clipPath id=\"cg351\"><rect x=\"50\" y=\"30\" width=\"386\" height=\"258\"/></clipPath></defs><line x1=\"76.7\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"76.7\" y2=\"288\" stroke=\"#2A3548\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"159.8\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"159.8\" y2=\"288\" stroke=\"#2A3548\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"326.2\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"326.2\" y2=\"288\" stroke=\"#2A3548\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"409.3\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"409.3\" y2=\"288\" stroke=\"#2A3548\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"242.2\" x2=\"436\" y2=\"242.2\" stroke=\"#2A3548\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"75.8\" x2=\"436\" y2=\"75.8\" stroke=\"#2A3548\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"159.0\" x2=\"436\" y2=\"159.0\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><polygon points=\"436,159.0 428,155.0 428,163.0\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"434\" y=\"151.0\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"end\">x</text><line x1=\"243.0\" y1=\"288\" x2=\"243.0\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><polygon points=\"243.0,30 239.0,38 247.0,38\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"251.0\" y=\"34\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"13\">y</text><text x=\"249.0\" y=\"173.0\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\">O</text><text x=\"76.7\" y=\"175.0\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">-4</text><text x=\"159.8\" y=\"175.0\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">-2</text><text x=\"326.2\" y=\"175.0\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><text x=\"409.3\" y=\"175.0\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text><text x=\"237.0\" y=\"246.2\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\">-2</text><text x=\"237.0\" y=\"79.8\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\">2</text><g clip-path=\"url(#cg351)\"><ellipse cx=\"243.0\" cy=\"159.0\" rx=\"41.6\" ry=\"41.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#00EDFF\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><line x1=\"243.0\" y1=\"159.0\" x2=\"284.6\" y2=\"159.0\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/></g><text x=\"261.7\" y=\"159.0\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"start\">r = 1</text><circle cx=\"243.0\" cy=\"159.0\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#F0B90B\" stroke=\"#1e1e1e\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"251.0\" y=\"153.0\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"start\">center (0, 0)</text></svg>"},
  {"type": "math_show", "q": "Find the center and radius of the circle $(x-2)^2 + (y-4)^2 = 16$.", "c": "<strong>အဖြေရှင်းလင်းချက်:</strong><br><br>Given: $(x-2)^2 + (y-4)^2 = 16$<br><br>Step 1: Compare with standard form $(x-h)^2 + (y-k)^2 = r^2$.<br><br>$(x-2)^2 + (y-4)^2 = 4^2$<br><br>Step 2: Identify center and radius.<br><br>Center: $(h,k) = (2, 4)$<br><br>Radius: $r = 4$<br><br><strong>center $= (2, 4)$, radius $= 4$</strong><br><svg viewBox=\"0 0 460 330\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Circle center (2, 4) radius 4\" data-chapter-graph=\"1\"><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#1e1e1e\"/><defs><clipPath id=\"cg352\"><rect x=\"50\" y=\"30\" width=\"386\" height=\"258\"/></clipPath></defs><line x1=\"136.1\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"136.1\" y2=\"288\" stroke=\"#2A3548\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"288.8\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"288.8\" y2=\"288\" stroke=\"#2A3548\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"365.2\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"365.2\" y2=\"288\" stroke=\"#2A3548\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"143.7\" x2=\"436\" y2=\"143.7\" stroke=\"#2A3548\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"67.4\" x2=\"436\" y2=\"67.4\" stroke=\"#2A3548\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"220.1\" x2=\"436\" y2=\"220.1\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><polygon points=\"436,220.1 428,216.1 428,224.1\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"434\" y=\"212.1\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"end\">x</text><line x1=\"212.5\" y1=\"288\" x2=\"212.5\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><polygon points=\"212.5,30 208.5,38 216.5,38\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"220.5\" y=\"34\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"13\">y</text><text x=\"218.5\" y=\"234.1\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\">O</text><text x=\"136.1\" y=\"236.1\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">-5</text><text x=\"288.8\" y=\"236.1\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5</text><text x=\"365.2\" y=\"236.1\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">10</text><text x=\"206.5\" y=\"147.7\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\">5</text><text x=\"206.5\" y=\"71.4\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\">10</text><g clip-path=\"url(#cg352)\"><ellipse cx=\"243.0\" cy=\"159.0\" rx=\"61.1\" ry=\"61.1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#00EDFF\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><line x1=\"243.0\" y1=\"159.0\" x2=\"304.1\" y2=\"159.0\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/></g><text x=\"270.5\" y=\"159.0\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"start\">r = 4</text><circle cx=\"243.0\" cy=\"159.0\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#F0B90B\" stroke=\"#1e1e1e\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"251.0\" y=\"153.0\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"start\">center (2, 4)</text></svg>"},
  {"type": "math_show", "q": "The equation of the circle is $x^2 + y^2 - 4x + 2y - 11 = 0$. The center and radius of the circle are $(x_1, y_1)$ and $r$, respectively, then find $r(x_1 + y_1)$.", "c": "<strong>အဖြေရှင်းလင်းချက်:</strong><br><br>Given: $x^2 + y^2 - 4x + 2y - 11 = 0$<br><br>Step 1: Group and complete the square.<br><br>$(x^2 - 4x) + (y^2 + 2y) = 11$<br><br>$(x^2 - 4x + 4) + (y^2 + 2y + 1) = 11 + 4 + 1$<br><br>$(x - 2)^2 + (y + 1)^2 = 16$<br><br>Step 2: Identify center and radius.<br><br>Center: $(x_1, y_1) = (2, -1)$<br><br>Radius: $r = \\sqrt{16} = 4$<br><br>Step 3: Calculate $r(x_1 + y_1)$.<br><br>$r(x_1 + y_1) = 4(2 + (-1)) = 4(1) = 4$<br><br><strong>$4$</strong><br><svg viewBox=\"0 0 460 330\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Circle center (2, -1) radius 4\" data-chapter-graph=\"1\"><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#1e1e1e\"/><defs><clipPath id=\"cg353\"><rect x=\"50\" y=\"30\" width=\"386\" height=\"258\"/></clipPath></defs><line x1=\"136.1\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"136.1\" y2=\"288\" stroke=\"#2A3548\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"288.8\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"288.8\" y2=\"288\" stroke=\"#2A3548\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"365.2\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"365.2\" y2=\"288\" stroke=\"#2A3548\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"220.1\" x2=\"436\" y2=\"220.1\" stroke=\"#2A3548\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"67.4\" x2=\"436\" y2=\"67.4\" stroke=\"#2A3548\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"143.7\" x2=\"436\" y2=\"143.7\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><polygon points=\"436,143.7 428,139.7 428,147.7\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"434\" y=\"135.7\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"end\">x</text><line x1=\"212.5\" y1=\"288\" x2=\"212.5\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><polygon points=\"212.5,30 208.5,38 216.5,38\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"220.5\" y=\"34\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"13\">y</text><text x=\"218.5\" y=\"157.7\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\">O</text><text x=\"136.1\" y=\"159.7\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">-5</text><text x=\"288.8\" y=\"159.7\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5</text><text x=\"365.2\" y=\"159.7\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">10</text><text x=\"206.5\" y=\"224.1\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\">-5</text><text x=\"206.5\" y=\"71.4\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\">5</text><g clip-path=\"url(#cg353)\"><ellipse cx=\"243.0\" cy=\"159.0\" rx=\"61.1\" ry=\"61.1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#00EDFF\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><line x1=\"243.0\" y1=\"159.0\" x2=\"304.1\" y2=\"159.0\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/></g><text x=\"270.5\" y=\"159.0\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"start\">r = 4</text><circle cx=\"243.0\" cy=\"159.0\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#F0B90B\" stroke=\"#1e1e1e\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"251.0\" y=\"153.0\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"start\">center (2, -1)</text></svg>"},
  {"type": "math_show", "q": "The line $x + 1 = 0$ is the directrix of a parabola $y^2 = -kx$. Find the value of $k$.", "c": "<strong>အဖြေရှင်းလင်းချက်:</strong><br><br>Given: Parabola $y^2 = -kx$<br><br>Directrix: $x + 1 = 0$, i.e., $x = -1$<br><br>Step 1: For a parabola with vertex at origin and directrix $x = -1$:<br><br>The focus is at $(1, 0)$ (vertex is midway between focus and directrix).<br><br>Distance from vertex to focus: $p = 1$<br><br>Step 2: Since focus is on positive $x$-axis, parabola opens right.<br><br>Standard form: $y^2 = 4px = 4(1)x = 4x$<br><br>Step 3: Compare with $y^2 = -kx$.<br><br>$-kx = 4x$<br><br>$-k = 4$<br><br>$k = -4$<br><br><strong>$k = -4$</strong>"},
  {"type": "math_show", "q": "Find the general form of the equation of the circle with diameter has end points $(7, -13)$ and $(1, 3)$.", "c": "<strong>အဖြေရှင်းလင်းချက်:</strong><br><br>Given: End points of diameter: $(7, -13)$ and $(1, 3)$<br><br>Step 1: Find the center (midpoint of diameter).<br><br>$h = \\frac{7 + 1}{2} = \\frac{8}{2} = 4$<br><br>$k = \\frac{-13 + 3}{2} = \\frac{-10}{2} = -5$<br><br>Center: $(4, -5)$<br><br>Step 2: Find the radius (half the diameter length).<br><br>$d = \\sqrt{(7-1)^2 + (-13-3)^2} = \\sqrt{6^2 + (-16)^2} = \\sqrt{36 + 256} = \\sqrt{292}$<br><br>$r = \\frac{\\sqrt{292}}{2} = \\sqrt{73}$<br><br>$r^2 = 73$<br><br>Step 3: Write standard form and convert to general form.<br><br>$(x-4)^2 + (y+5)^2 = 73$<br><br>$x^2 - 8x + 16 + y^2 + 10y + 25 = 73$<br><br>$x^2 + y^2 - 8x + 10y + 41 - 73 = 0$<br><br>$x^2 + y^2 - 8x + 10y - 32 = 0$<br><br><strong>$x^2 + y^2 - 8x + 10y - 32 = 0$</strong><br><svg viewBox=\"0 0 460 330\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Circle center (4, -5) radius 8.54\" data-chapter-graph=\"1\"><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#1e1e1e\"/><defs><clipPath id=\"cg354\"><rect x=\"50\" y=\"30\" width=\"386\" height=\"258\"/></clipPath></defs><line x1=\"133.8\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"133.8\" y2=\"288\" stroke=\"#2A3548\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"289.8\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"289.8\" y2=\"288\" stroke=\"#2A3548\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"367.7\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"367.7\" y2=\"288\" stroke=\"#2A3548\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"276.0\" x2=\"436\" y2=\"276.0\" stroke=\"#2A3548\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"198.0\" x2=\"436\" y2=\"198.0\" stroke=\"#2A3548\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"42.0\" x2=\"436\" y2=\"42.0\" stroke=\"#2A3548\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"120.0\" x2=\"436\" y2=\"120.0\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><polygon points=\"436,120.0 428,116.0 428,124.0\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"434\" y=\"112.0\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"end\">x</text><line x1=\"211.8\" y1=\"288\" x2=\"211.8\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><polygon points=\"211.8,30 207.8,38 215.8,38\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"219.8\" y=\"34\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"13\">y</text><text x=\"217.8\" y=\"134.0\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\">O</text><text x=\"133.8\" y=\"136.0\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">-10</text><text x=\"289.8\" y=\"136.0\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">10</text><text x=\"367.7\" y=\"136.0\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">20</text><text x=\"205.8\" y=\"280.0\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\">-20</text><text x=\"205.8\" y=\"202.0\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\">-10</text><text x=\"205.8\" y=\"46.0\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\">10</text><g clip-path=\"url(#cg354)\"><ellipse cx=\"243.0\" cy=\"159.0\" rx=\"66.6\" ry=\"66.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#00EDFF\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><line x1=\"243.0\" y1=\"159.0\" x2=\"266.4\" y2=\"221.4\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/></g><text x=\"254.7\" y=\"190.2\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"start\">r = 8.54</text><circle cx=\"243.0\" cy=\"159.0\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#F0B90B\" stroke=\"#1e1e1e\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"251.0\" y=\"153.0\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"start\">center (4, -5)</text><circle cx=\"266.4\" cy=\"221.4\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#FF5C5C\" stroke=\"#1e1e1e\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"274.4\" y=\"215.4\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"start\">(7, -13)</text><circle cx=\"219.6\" cy=\"96.6\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#FF5C5C\" stroke=\"#1e1e1e\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"227.6\" y=\"90.6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"start\">(1, 3)</text></svg>"},
  {"type": "math_show", "q": "If the line $y - \\frac{1}{4} = 0$ is the directrix of a parabola $x^2 + ky = 0$, find the value of $k$.", "c": "<strong>အဖြေရှင်းလင်းချက်:</strong><br><br>Given: Parabola $x^2 + ky = 0$, i.e., $x^2 = -ky$<br><br>Directrix: $y - \\frac{1}{4} = 0$, i.e., $y = \\frac{1}{4}$<br><br>Step 1: Compare $x^2 = -ky$ with standard forms.<br><br>For $x^2 = -4py$ (opens downward):<br><br>$-4p = -k$, so $k = 4p$<br><br>Directrix: $y = p$<br><br>Step 2: Given directrix $y = \\frac{1}{4}$.<br><br>So $p = \\frac{1}{4}$<br><br>Step 3: Find $k$.<br><br>$k = 4p = 4(\\frac{1}{4}) = 1$<br><br><strong>$k = 1$</strong>"},
  {"type": "math_show", "q": "If the coordinates are rotated through the angle of $\\theta = 45°$, then the new coordinate of the point $(x, y)$ is $(2, 0)$. Find the point $(x, y)$.", "c": "<strong>အဖြေရှင်းလင်းချက်:</strong><br><br>Given: Rotation angle $\\theta = 45°$<br><br>New coordinates: $(x', y') = (2, 0)$<br><br>Step 1: Use rotation formulas to find original coordinates.<br><br>$x = x' \\cos \\theta - y' \\sin \\theta$<br><br>$y = x' \\sin \\theta + y' \\cos \\theta$<br><br>Step 2: Substitute values.<br><br>$\\cos 45° = \\sin 45° = \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$<br><br>$x = 2(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}) - 0(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}) = \\sqrt{2}$<br><br>$y = 2(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}) + 0(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}) = \\sqrt{2}$<br><br><strong>$(x, y) = (\\sqrt{2}, \\sqrt{2})$</strong>"},
  {"type": "math_show", "q": "The line $y + 4 = 0$ is the directrix of a parabola $x^2 = ky$. Find the value of $k$.", "c": "<strong>အဖြေရှင်းလင်းချက်:</strong><br><br>Given: Parabola $x^2 = ky$<br><br>Directrix: $y + 4 = 0$, i.e., $y = -4$<br><br>Step 1: Compare with standard form $x^2 = 4py$.<br><br>$4p = k$<br><br>Step 2: For $x^2 = 4py$ (opens upward when $p > 0$):<br><br>Directrix: $y = -p$<br><br>Given $y = -4 = -p$<br><br>So $p = 4$<br><br>Step 3: Find $k$.<br><br>$k = 4p = 4(4) = 16$<br><br><strong>$k = 16$</strong>"},
  {"type": "math_show", "q": "Find the equation of the parabola with vertex $(0,0)$, focus on the positive $y$-axis and passing through $(-3, 3)$.", "c": "<strong>အဖြေရှင်းလင်းချက်:</strong><br><br>Given: Vertex $(0,0)$, focus on positive $y$-axis<br><br>Step 1: Since focus is on positive $y$-axis, the parabola opens upward.<br><br>Standard form: $x^2 = 4py$ where $p > 0$<br><br>Step 2: The parabola passes through $(-3, 3)$.<br><br>Substitute $x = -3$, $y = 3$:<br><br>$(-3)^2 = 4p(3)$<br><br>$9 = 12p$<br><br>$p = \\frac{9}{12} = \\frac{3}{4}$<br><br>Step 3: Write the equation.<br><br>$x^2 = 4(\\frac{3}{4})y$<br><br>$x^2 = 3y$<br><br><strong>$x^2 = 3y$</strong>"},
  {"type": "math_show", "q": "The line $x - 1 = 0$ is the directrix of a parabola $(y-1)^2 = k(x+2)$. Find the value of $k$.", "c": "<strong>အဖြေရှင်းလင်းချက်:</strong><br><br>Given: Parabola $(y-1)^2 = k(x+2)$<br><br>Directrix: $x - 1 = 0$, i.e., $x = 1$<br><br>Step 1: Rewrite in standard form.<br><br>$(y-1)^2 = k(x-(-2))$<br><br>Vertex: $(h,k) = (-2, 1)$<br><br>Step 2: For $(y-k)^2 = 4p(x-h)$ (opens right) or $(y-k)^2 = -4p(x-h)$ (opens left).<br><br>Since directrix $x = 1$ is to the right of vertex $x = -2$, parabola opens left.<br><br>$(y-1)^2 = -4p(x+2)$<br><br>So $k = -4p$<br><br>Step 3: For parabola opening left, directrix is $x = h + p = -2 + p$.<br><br>$-2 + p = 1$<br><br>$p = 3$<br><br>Step 4: Find $k$.<br><br>$k = -4p = -4(3) = -12$<br><br><strong>$k = -12$</strong>"},
  {"type": "math_show", "q": "Find the focus and directrix of $x^2 + 8y = 0$.", "c": "<strong>အဖြေရှင်းလင်းချက်:</strong><br><br>Given: $x^2 + 8y = 0$<br><br>Step 1: Rewrite in standard form.<br><br>$x^2 = -8y$<br><br>Step 2: Compare with $x^2 = -4py$.<br><br>$-4p = -8$<br><br>$p = 2$<br><br>Step 3: For $x^2 = -4py$ (opens downward):<br><br>Focus: $(0, -p) = (0, -2)$<br><br>Directrix: $y = p = 2$<br><br><strong>focus: $(0, -2)$, directrix: $y = 2$</strong>"},
  {"type": "math_show", "q": "The line $y - 1 = 0$ is the directrix of a parabola $x^2 = ky$. Find the value of $k$.", "c": "<strong>အဖြေရှင်းလင်းချက်:</strong><br><br>Given: Parabola $x^2 = ky$<br><br>Directrix: $y - 1 = 0$, i.e., $y = 1$<br><br>Step 1: Compare with standard form $x^2 = 4py$.<br><br>$4p = k$<br><br>Step 2: For $x^2 = 4py$ (opens upward when $p > 0$):<br><br>Directrix: $y = -p$<br><br>Given $y = 1 = -p$<br><br>So $p = -1$<br><br>Since $p < 0$, the parabola opens downward.<br><br>For $x^2 = -4py$ with $p > 0$ (opens downward):<br><br>Directrix: $y = p$<br><br>So $p = 1$<br><br>Step 3: Find $k$.<br><br>$x^2 = -4py = -4(1)y = -4y$<br><br>So $k = -4$<br><br><strong>$k = -4$</strong>"},
  {"type": "math_show", "q": "Find the standard form of the equation of the parabola with vertex $(3, 2)$ and focus at $(3, 5)$.", "c": "<strong>အဖြေရှင်းလင်းချက်:</strong><br><br>Given: Vertex $(3, 2)$, Focus $(3, 5)$<br><br>Step 1: Determine orientation.<br><br>Since $x$-coordinates are the same, the axis is vertical.<br><br>Focus is above vertex, so parabola opens upward.<br><br>Step 2: Find $p$.<br><br>$p = 5 - 2 = 3$<br><br>Step 3: Use standard form for vertical parabola opening up.<br><br>$(x-h)^2 = 4p(y-k)$<br><br>$(x-3)^2 = 4(3)(y-2)$<br><br>$(x-3)^2 = 12(y-2)$<br><br><strong>$(x-3)^2 = 12(y-2)$</strong><br><svg viewBox=\"0 0 460 330\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Parabola with vertex, focus and directrix\" data-chapter-graph=\"1\"><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#1e1e1e\"/><defs><clipPath id=\"cg355\"><rect x=\"50\" y=\"30\" width=\"386\" height=\"258\"/></clipPath></defs><line x1=\"63.8\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"63.8\" y2=\"288\" stroke=\"#2A3548\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"324.4\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"324.4\" y2=\"288\" stroke=\"#2A3548\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"237.2\" x2=\"436\" y2=\"237.2\" stroke=\"#2A3548\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"106.9\" x2=\"436\" y2=\"106.9\" stroke=\"#2A3548\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"41.7\" x2=\"436\" y2=\"41.7\" stroke=\"#2A3548\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"172.0\" x2=\"436\" y2=\"172.0\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><polygon points=\"436,172.0 428,168.0 428,176.0\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"434\" y=\"164.0\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"end\">x</text><line x1=\"194.1\" y1=\"288\" x2=\"194.1\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><polygon points=\"194.1,30 190.1,38 198.1,38\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"202.1\" y=\"34\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"13\">y</text><text x=\"200.1\" y=\"186.0\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\">O</text><text x=\"63.8\" y=\"188.0\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">-20</text><text x=\"324.4\" y=\"188.0\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">20</text><text x=\"188.1\" y=\"241.2\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\">-10</text><text x=\"188.1\" y=\"110.9\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\">10</text><text x=\"188.1\" y=\"45.7\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\">20</text><g clip-path=\"url(#cg355)\"><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"178.5\" x2=\"436\" y2=\"178.5\" stroke=\"#94A3B8\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-dasharray=\"6,4\"/><polyline points=\"135.5,80.8 137.5,84.7 139.4,88.4 141.4,92.1 143.3,95.7 145.3,99.1 147.2,102.5 149.2,105.8 151.1,109.0 153.1,112.0 155.0,115.0 157.0,117.9 159.0,120.7 160.9,123.4 162.9,126.0 164.8,128.5 166.8,130.9 168.7,133.2 170.7,135.3 172.6,137.5 174.6,139.5 176.5,141.4 178.5,143.2 180.5,144.9 182.4,146.5 184.4,148.0 186.3,149.4 188.3,150.7 190.2,152.0 192.2,153.1 194.1,154.1 196.1,155.0 198.0,155.9 200.0,156.6 202.0,157.2 203.9,157.8 205.9,158.2 207.8,158.6 209.8,158.8 211.7,159.0 213.7,159.0 215.6,159.0 217.6,158.8 219.5,158.6 221.5,158.2 223.5,157.8 225.4,157.2 227.4,156.6 229.3,155.9 231.3,155.0 233.2,154.1 235.2,153.1 237.1,152.0 239.1,150.7 241.0,149.4 243.0,148.0 245.0,146.5 246.9,144.9 248.9,143.2 250.8,141.4 252.8,139.5 254.7,137.5 256.7,135.3 258.6,133.2 260.6,130.9 262.5,128.5 264.5,126.0 266.5,123.4 268.4,120.7 270.4,117.9 272.3,115.0 274.3,112.0 276.2,109.0 278.2,105.8 280.1,102.5 282.1,99.1 284.0,95.7 286.0,92.1 288.0,88.4 289.9,84.7 291.9,80.8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#00EDFF\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"174.6\" y1=\"139.5\" x2=\"252.8\" y2=\"139.5\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></g><text x=\"432.0\" y=\"174.5\" fill=\"#F0B90B\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\">y = -1</text><circle cx=\"213.7\" cy=\"159.0\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#F0B90B\" stroke=\"#1e1e1e\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"221.7\" y=\"153.0\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"start\">vertex (3, 2)</text><circle cx=\"213.7\" cy=\"139.5\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#00EDFF\" stroke=\"#1e1e1e\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"221.7\" y=\"133.5\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"start\">focus (3, 5)</text><circle cx=\"174.6\" cy=\"139.5\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1e1e1e\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"252.8\" cy=\"139.5\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1e1e1e\" stroke-width=\"1\"/></svg>"},
  {"type": "math_show", "q": "The line $x = -1$ is the directrix of a parabola $(y-2)^2 = k(x+3)$. Find the value of $k$.", "c": "<strong>အဖြေရှင်းလင်းချက်:</strong><br><br>Given: Parabola $(y-2)^2 = k(x+3)$<br><br>Directrix: $x = -1$<br><br>Step 1: Rewrite in standard form.<br><br>$(y-2)^2 = k(x-(-3))$<br><br>Vertex: $(h,k) = (-3, 2)$<br><br>Step 2: Since directrix $x = -1$ is to the right of vertex $x = -3$, parabola opens left.<br><br>$(y-2)^2 = -4p(x+3)$<br><br>So $k = -4p$<br><br>Step 3: For parabola opening left, directrix is $x = h + p = -3 + p$.<br><br>$-3 + p = -1$<br><br>$p = 2$<br><br>Step 4: Find $k$.<br><br>$k = -4p = -4(2) = -8$<br><br><strong>$k = -8$</strong>"}
]
